{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "John in Belize", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Belize River Challenge", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 9, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Simple Present vs. The Present Continuous", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Present tense to talk about a routine or a specific action that happens regularly.<br> You can use expressions of frequency like <span class=\"italic\"> every day</span> or <span class=\"italic\">always</span> with the Simple Present.<br><br>You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about an action happening right now. You can also use the Present Continuous to talk about events that  <span class=\"strong\">are happening</span> soon.  You make the Present Continuous with the verb <span class=\"strong\">to be + -ing</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Simple\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I stay in the office until late every day.<br> The race celebrates the Maya culture.<br> I always bring my lunch to work.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm staying in the office until late today.<br> I'm celebrating my friend's birthday later.<br> I'm bringing the tour group on the challenge tomorrow!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Do you usually take part in the River Challenge?<br> When does the race start? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Are you taking part in the River Challenge this year?<br> When is the race starting this week? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I don't usually go sightseeing.<br> He doesn't find museums interesting. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'm not going sightseeing with the group today.<br> We aren't finding this museum interesting. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to mark", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to remember; to celebrate", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This year marks the 16th anniversary of the race.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about an important event.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "challenge ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something difficult", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Belize River Challenge takes four days to complete.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "annual", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that happens every year ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm participating in the annual Belize River Challenge!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "remarkable ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "worthy of admiring", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Mayan culture is remarkable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "legacy ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something received from past generations ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The River Challenge celebrates the Maya legacy in Belize.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "descendant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "from the same family line or culture", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Many descendants of the Maya still use the river today.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I'm having the time of my life!", "type": "name"}, {"content": "I'm having a lot of fun!", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Belize River Challenge is exciting. I'm having the time of my life!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le09ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of an event that happens in your country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph of 5-8 lines about the event. Include answers to the following questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Why is it special? What does it celebrate?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "How often does it happen? How long does it last?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Who can participate in the event?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the paragraph aloud to your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I compile background information about a national event.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about traditions and customs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my paragraph with my partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn4le09ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le09ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Hey Peter! What's up? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Work is tiring. I stay in the office until late. How about you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Me? I'm having the time of my life! We are in Belize right now!"}, {"image": "engenn4le09ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "14000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Wow! Sounds fun! What are your plans?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I'm planning to take part in the Belize River Challenge!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What's that?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: It's an annual race. This year marks the 16th anniversary."}, {"image": "engenn4le09ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "28000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How long is it?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: The race takes four days. It celebrates the Maya's use of the river for transportation. Many descendants of the Maya still use it today.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sounds interesting!"}, {"image": "engenn4le09ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "41000", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Yes! I'm excited. I'm bringing my group on the challenge!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: When are you starting?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: On Sunday! Today we are sightseeing. The Maya legacy is remarkable!"}, {"image": "engenn4le09ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "54000", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I believe you! Tell me how it goes!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: OK! Talk later! My connection is getting bad."}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le09ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le09ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn4le09ob07re6aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le09ob07re6img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about traditions and customs. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can ask and talk about what people do. ", "typ